    prov:used <http://example.org/research-ontology/6.9.2> ;
    rdfs:comment "MINOR enrichment release per BP-D13. Applied the RRWPC research ontology v6.9.2's discovery-method classes (ro:SearchEngineQuery for finding seminal sources; ro:DiscoveryAttempt for per-source liveness; ro:CitationChainTraversal for following Shneiderman 1996 -> Ahlberg & Shneiderman 1994 and Heer & Shneiderman 2012 -> Segel & Heer 2010) to extract four new widget primitives from two well-attested information-visualization seminal sources. Each new primitive carries the BP-D32 triple (demonstratesSubject + hasDomainConstraint + hasTestProcedure) plus BP-D28 source citation with DOI. Added one supporting provenance-badge subclass (wp:PrimaryAcademicSourceBadge) to distinguish peer-reviewed academic-source citations from non-academic primary sources. v1.0.0 individuals byte-identical (BP-D7 MINOR-bump discipline)."@en .

